entries[1230068] = { ["name"] = "Thalassian Competitor's Insignia of Alacrity", ["text"] = "2 sec cast 2\nReagents:\nThalassian Songwater (3), Soul Cipher (4), Munsell Ink (2), Competitor's Heraldry (#471) (4)\nOptional Reagents:\nVendor:\nMirvedon\nZone:\nSilvermoon City\nCost:\n7500\n\nThalassian Competitor's Insignia of Alacrity\nBinds when equipped\nUnique-EquippedTrinket\n+ 63 Haste\nEquip: Your spells and abilities have a chance to grant 112 primary stat for 20 sec.\n70\n\nGladiator's Distinction (0/2)\nGladiator's Emblem\nGladiator's Medallion" }
